contentText:
As Nas once said, &#8220;War Is Necessary.&#8221; The Queensbridge rap legend has just about seen it all in his more than three decades as a hip-hop dignitary, but he feels that the genre&#8217;s fabric has eroded compared to the formative era he was raised in.

